# Investigation Report — Fischertechnik Lab C Digital Twin

## Evidence baseline (confirmed by re-running the three checks)
- **Contract test:** PASS (25/25, no failures, no warnings). The code is a faithful, deterministic implementation of the spec — so every discrepancy below is a **spec decision**, not a code bug.
- **Behavioural (30 reps):** `completed_cases` sim 25.9 vs obs 13 (+99.2%, PI [17.4, 35.3] does not cover 13); `flow_time_completed` 951.7 vs 597.5 (+59.3%); `time_in_system_all` 733.0 vs 430.6 (+70.2%); `cases_entered` 46.2 vs 37 (+24.9%); `mean_wip` 9.11 vs 6.07 (+50.1%); `wip_at_T` 20.3 vs 24 (−15.4%); vgr wait 100.8 vs 19.4; hbw wait 103.2 vs 177.9; `idle_s` 496.4 vs 169.5 (+192.8%).
- **Metamorphic:** MR1 pass, MR2 pass, **MR3 FAIL** (flow 591.0 → 902.2 when `FAILURES_ENABLED=False`), MR4 pass.

